dsl Metta

Concept:Single Unit
	has:Single:Required Label
	has Subject

Concept Module
	has:Single:Required Label
	has Subject

	Concept Pin
		def string context
		has:Single:Required Label
		Concept:{1..1} Content
			sub Singleton
				def string id
			sub Query
				def string type
				def string condition = empty

Concept Action
	has:Single:Required Label
	Concept:Single Hint > def string message
	Concept:Single Acccess > def string[] roles

	Concept:{1..1} Context
		def string[] names

		facet Transient

		facet Status
			sub Visible
			Concept:{1..1} IfEquals
				def string tag
				def string value

	facet Operation
		Concept Parameter
			def string label
			def string[] options

	facet Edition
		Concept:{0..1} Dialog
			def string name

		Concept Required
			def string[] tags
			def string message
			Concept:Single When
				def string tag
				def string[] value

	facet Download
		def string[] options = empty

	facet Async

	facet Affirmed
		def string text

Concept Rule
	sub After
		def Action action
		Concept When > def string condition
		Concept:{1..1} Next > def Action action // Regla semántica: La acción que se ponga como next debe ser transient


Concept Label as component
	def string value
	def resource icon = empty

Concept Subject as component
	def string type
	Concept:Single Access
		def string[] roles
		Concept:Single Edition > def string[] roles
		Concept:Single Signing > def string[] roles





